35,2,1,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: I saw how people at that other house just left the hall heater on all January. No one flinched.,"{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
36,2,1,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: The electrician quoted 34,000 yen per room for meters. That is a significant upfront cost before we even start.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
37,2,1,talk,Rin,,- **Rin**: The template trial was a nightmare. Keying in every invoice and calculating five separate refunds would eat my whole evening.,"{""words"":22,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
38,2,1,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: The monitors show one room drawing four times the lightest. That gap is real, not a rumour.","{""words"":19,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
39,2,1,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: The payment log shows three months settled late, always after someone questioned the amount. The friction is real.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
40,2,2,talk,Mio,,- **Mio**: That sounds like freedom. I hate doing mental math before I even turn the lights on.,"{""words"":18,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
41,2,2,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Mio, that freedom has a price. Thirty-four thousand yen per room is a heavy upfront cost for us to absorb.","{""words"":22,""mentions"":[""Mio""],""raw_differs"":false}"
42,2,2,talk,Rin,,#### Turn 2 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
43,2,2,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: @Ryuji, upfront cost is one thing. The monitor data proves the current split is mathematically unfair. We need to address the disparity.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
44,2,2,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Shunichi, the data proves the split is unfair, but the log proves the arguing is what actually hurts us.","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
45,2,3,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: @Misaki, exactly. I’d rather pay a fair share than dread the conversation. What if we just split it evenly?","{""words"":21,""mentions"":[""Misaki""],""raw_differs"":false}"
46,2,3,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: @Mio, even splits ignore the four-to-one usage gap Shunichi found. I need to see the full year's variance before agreeing to that.","{""words"":24,""mentions"":[""Mio"",""Shunichi""],""raw_differs"":false}"
47,2,3,talk,Rin,,#### Turn 3 of 4,"{""words"":5,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
48,2,3,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: @Ryuji, the variance is the problem. A flat split just hides the four-to-one gap under a polite smile.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
49,2,3,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Ryuji, I understand the caution. But if we wait for perfect data, we keep paying for the silence.","{""words"":20,""mentions"":[""Ryuji""],""raw_differs"":false}"
50,2,4,talk,Mio,,"- **Mio**: I just want to stop calculating in my head. If we can't agree on the numbers, can we at least agree on the feeling?","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
51,2,4,talk,Ryuji,,"- **Ryuji**: I hear you, but feelings don't balance a ledger. I need the full year's variance to know if a fixed rate is even viable.","{""words"":26,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
52,2,4,talk,Rin,,- **Rin**: I looked at the other house's settle. Forty minutes of logging and arguing. I refuse to be the one doing that every month.,"{""words"":25,""mentions"":[],""raw_differs"":false}"
53,2,4,talk,Shunichi,,"- **Shunichi**: @Rin, then we need a system that doesn't require a monthly audit. The data supports moving away from the current method.","{""words"":23,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
54,2,4,talk,Misaki,,"- **Misaki**: @Rin, I agree. The last time we tried to settle up, it took three weeks and ended in a write-off. We need to stop that cycle.","{""words"":28,""mentions"":[""Rin""],""raw_differs"":false}"
